{"title":"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>During the week, the Toronto Stock Exchange made the following gains and losses: Monday <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b106a021335321ab013caaebac9c0966655d4659.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, Tuesday <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/757f43bd8ee501ab9ff6683a0599c0338c0b1680.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+106$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, Wednesday <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa9e094aa4e4f1bad5fe74b924081b193d383681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, Thursday <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/72893ef30f343c4aa901efb4d7599ce7106061c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+182$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, and Friday <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67b9833d3e8f419f1f0461db4f87d50fd67677fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. What was the net change for the week?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da848c33d69bb11ad86ffb73bacf853ce53ab78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) a loss of 119} \\quad \\text{(B) a gain of 119} \\quad \\text{(C) a gain of 91} \\quad \\text{(D) a loss of 91} \\quad \\text{(E) a gain of 695}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"663\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Proble